{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04939","headline":"九日幸临渭亭登高应制得历字 · 薛稷","name":"九日幸临渭亭登高应制得历字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暮节乘原野，宣游俯崖壁。\n秋登华实满，气严鹰隼击。\n仙菊含霜泛，圣藻临云锡。\n愿陪九九辰，长奉千千历。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛稷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}